{"3748390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Who's beast", "steam_appid": 3748390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a medieval village where betrayal hides behind every smile…</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This online multiplayer game pits up to 12 players against each other in a battle of trust, strategy, and survival. Among the noble knights, impostors lurk—able to shapeshift into terrifying creatures like the <strong>Banshee</strong>, <strong>Basilisk</strong>, or <strong>Werewolf</strong> to hunt their prey under the cover of darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match unfolds in real time, driven by a dynamic <strong>day/night cycle</strong>. Work together to complete quests, gather clues, and find scattered weapons—but be careful who you trust. Not everyone has noble intentions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 3 to 12 players online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👹 1 to 3 impostors with monstrous transformations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌙 Real-time day/night cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗡️ Quests, skills, and randomized weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔍 Tense, paranoid atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Online multiplayer only</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust no one. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a medieval village where betrayal hides behind every smile…</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This online multiplayer game pits up to 12 players against each other in a battle of trust, strategy, and survival. Among the noble knights, impostors lurk—able to shapeshift into terrifying creatures like the <strong>Banshee</strong>, <strong>Basilisk</strong>, or <strong>Werewolf</strong> to hunt their prey under the cover of darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match unfo